A caption number stops no delimiter glued after its placeholder

```
![i](a.png)
^ Figure a#*b*
.
<figure>
  <img src="a.png" alt="i">
  <figcaption>Figure a1<strong>b</strong></figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![i](a.png)
^ Figure #=b=
.
<figure>
  <img src="a.png" alt="i">
  <figcaption>Figure 1<mark>b</mark></figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![i](a.png)
^ *a*#/b/
.
<figure>
  <img src="a.png" alt="i">
  <figcaption><strong>a</strong>1<em>b</em></figcaption>
</figure>
```
